+// Lightning deals the same total damage as Fire at the same spell level, but
+// spread over the lifetime of the ball or flash: one strike every 4 ticks,
+// each worth total/strikes. start and stop are the ball's or flash's. Strikes
+// are counted back from stop so none is lost on the tick the spell is cast.
+// The total is for 5 seconds (FLASHDURATION): a flash made longer by Duration
+// keeps striking at the same rate, so it deals more in total.
+static void add_strike(int xc, int yc, int x, int y, int str, int cn, int cc, int cnt, int start, int stop) {
